+`codex-rs/config/src/loader/mod.rs`, `codex-rs/codex-home/src/instructions/mod.rs`
+and `codex-rs/model-provider-info/src/lib.rs`.
+Official non-interactive/config documentation:
+https://developers.openai.com/codex/noninteractive/
+https://developers.openai.com/codex/config-reference/
